{"title":"금수의 밤 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=MpZPd/dJMcah0M6QR/k5HiYMVkwECo2J6qgrWotK&filename=th3","synopsis":"어미와 아비 모두를 앗아간 왕.심지어 제 자신마저 빼앗길 위기에 처했기에 서해는 결심했다.『왕의 더러운 금침 위에서 혀를 깨물고 죽으리라.』그렇게 억지로 합방을 하러 가던 순간,오랑캐 놈들이 수도까지 쳐들어왔다고 한다.짐승 같은 것들이 이 나라를 집어삼키러 왔다고 한다.왕이 바뀌고, 하늘이 바뀌었다고 한다.붉은 머리의 신은 들어본 적이 없음에도,모두가 금수라고 하는 이가 내게는 신이 되었다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-11-12","rank":30,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":68,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":76,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-11-12","rank":166,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-13","rank":145,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}}],"monthly":[{"date":"2026-11-14","rank":297,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}]},"viewSeries":[{"date":"2026-11-12","viewCount":"382.2만"},{"date":"2026-11-13","viewCount":"384.4만"},{"date":"2026-11-14","viewCount":"387.1만"}],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":2016089,"rc":4197,"rs":41324,"cc":512},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":2017044,"rc":4202,"rs":41374,"cc":512},{"date":"2026-10-09","v":2018075,"rc":4209,"rs":41444,"cc":512},{"date":"2026-10-10","v":2019041,"rc":4211,"rs":41464,"cc":512},{"date":"2026-10-11","v":2020202,"rc":4212,"rs":41474,"cc":512},{"date":"2026-10-12","v":2021249,"rc":4213,"rs":41484,"cc":513},{"date":"2026-10-13","v":2022296,"rc":4214,"rs":41494,"cc":513},{"date":"2026-10-14","v":2023249,"rc":4216,"rs":41514,"cc":513},{"date":"2026-10-15","v":2024175,"rc":4218,"rs":41534,"cc":513},{"date":"2026-10-16","v":2025174,"rc":4218,"rs":41534,"cc":513},{"date":"2026-10-17","v":2026229,"rc":4220,"rs":41554,"cc":514},{"date":"2026-10-18","v":2027330,"rc":4220,"rs":41554,"cc":515},{"date":"2026-10-19","v":2028428,"rc":4221,"rs":41564,"cc":515},{"date":"2026-10-20","v":2029540,"rc":4221,"rs":41564,"